# The root Dockerfile only copies what scripts/build-go.sh put in
# .image-build/, so nothing else is sent to the daemon: no source, and no
# stray data/ directory with a CA key in it. The Console and Studio have their
# own contexts and .dockerignore files.
#
# 根目录 Dockerfile 只拷贝 scripts/build-go.sh 放进 .image-build/ 的产物，因此其他一切都不
# 发送给 daemon：没有源码，也不会带上混在里面、装着 CA 私钥的 data/ 目录。Console 与 Studio
# 有各自的构建上下文与 .dockerignore。
*
!.image-build
